cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Bern2Edge, please cite the accompanying paper and the software release."
title: "Bern2Edge: A Neurosymbolic Compiler for Edge Deployment via Bernstein Polynomial Networks"
abstract: >-
  Software accompanying Bern2Edge, an end-to-end framework for distilling
  pretrained teacher networks into compact Bernstein Polynomial Networks and
  deploying them through LUT-based FPGA realizations or interpretable symbolic
  rules. The repository also includes robustness certification, distribution
  shift experiments, low-power FPGA deployment, and TinyBERT4 FFN experiments.
